Third-party data
----------------
This repository bundles no third-party datasets.

The SYBA Shield extension also ships a 25,000-host phishing blocklist built from
PhishTank (Cisco Talos) and Phishing.Database (MIT), and phishing-kit rules from
phish.report/IOK (ODbL 1.0). They are deliberately NOT included here:
  - The blocklist mixes PhishTank and Phishing.Database hosts without per-host
    source tags. PhishTank's published terms permit commercial and non-commercial
    use of its API but do not grant redistribution of its data, so the merged list
    cannot be republished under an open licence.
  - The IOK rules evaluate rendered page DOM, which none of these skills read.
If you add third-party data, keep it in its own folder with its licence and an
attribution line in this file.
